WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.716 --> 00:00:10.396
On the first of every month, RepBunny sums up the month you just finished, next to the month before.

2
00:00:10.749 --> 00:00:11.709
Here's how.

3
00:00:12.079 --> 00:00:15.679
Open the Progress tab, and scroll down to the report.

4
00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.113
Tap the report to open it.

5
00:00:18.466 --> 00:00:23.826
Workouts, sets, volume, and records, each next to the month before.

6
00:00:24.182 --> 00:00:26.582
Below that, every record you set,

7
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:30.933
your biggest strength gains, and the muscles you trained most.

8
00:00:31.283 --> 00:00:34.163
Tap the arrow to look back at earlier months.

9
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:39.477
The weekly numbers on Progress are free. Monthly reports are part of Premium.
